{
    "title": "Dorian: Comics Game Platform",
    "description": "Choose your shark lover in Rose Magpie\u2019s hit dating sim Shark Bait! Grow your relationship, unlock dates and join a fandom of romance simulation lovers! Explore your love story with pirates, vampires, mermen, bad boys and more! See your favorite visual novels played on interactive streams with hosts role playing in cosplay! Win extra prizes in trivia streams with your favorite creators! \r\n\r\nDorian is the first creation platform that lets independent creators stream, create, and play in one place! Explore a vast library of visual novels, otome adventures, lgbtq+ storytelling, dating simulators from creators all over the globe.\r\n\r\nKey features:\r\n\r\nVisual Novels & Dating Sims: Who needs to date IRL when you can choose the relationship of your dreams? Choose from gl, bl, gay, or any other romance that suits your preferences, and find your happy ending with your dream lover!\r\n\r\n\r\nBuild Your Relationship and Gain Free Bonuses: Level up your relationship with a number of love interests. Will you romance the Great White shark or the god of the sea? You choose \u2013 and raise your relationship level to unlock free intimate moments with your faves! \r\n\r\nJoin Live Streams with Famous Cosplayers: Meet iconic faves like Rose Magpie, Shinorisu, Wynter Phoenix, Inspector Lemon and more when you watch interactive livestreams! Cosplayers narrate and perform as your favorite characters, then you and other fans vote together to choose their destiny!\r\n\r\nParticipate in Events and Win Prizes: Dive into special events and challenges where you can showcase your skills, earn rewards, and get a chance to win exciting prizes. It's your time to shine in the spotlight!\r\n\r\nConnect with Your Fandom: Discover your community on Dorian! Share your passion through fan fiction, fan art and cosplay! Discuss with other fans and your favorite creators!\r\n\r\n\r\nLet\u2019s get social!\r\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/dorian.live/\r\nTikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@dorian.live\r\nDiscord: https://discord.gg/vCbqzjHvFs\r\n\r\nTerms of Use: https://dorian.live/#terms-of-use",
